                "text": "Take the magnitude and angle of the complex response. Here $|H(j\\omega)|=\\sqrt{(1/4)^2+(-1/4)^2}=1/(2\\sqrt{2})$, and the negative imaginary part with equal real and imaginary sizes puts the angle in the fourth quadrant.",
